..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
..  FOP-Name       : FERTLEIST2.BFUSS
..  Autor          : male
..  Verantwortlich : tiwe
..  Kontrolle      : cl
..  Funktion       : Berichtsfuss-FOP des Infosystems ko/FERTLEIST2
..  Functionality  : Report footer FOP of the Infosystem ko/FERTLEIST2
..*****************************************************************************
..
.set trans -
..
.formula   M|msumme  = M|mfixsum  + M|mvarsum
.formula   M|sksumme = M|skfixsum + M|skvarsum
.formula   M|gsumme  = M|msumme   + M|sksumme + M|bsumme
..
.continue END ? M|grouping = 0
.continue END ? M|tzeilen  = 0
..
.make screen line +O
.formula M|tsumme = M|grouping
.assign M|tkstelle = U|xplkst  ? M|grouping = 1
.copy M|tkstelle = M|kstelle ? M|grouping = 2
.assign M|tmgkstl  = U|xplkst  ? M|grouping = 2
.copy M|tmgkstl  = M|mgkstl  ? M|grouping = 1
.formula   M|twert    =  U|xrtwert
.colour -background 'U|xabassubtotal' 'M|aktzeile'
..
.continue END
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END: End
..*****************************************************************************
.continue

